However, Epic workloads and healthcare integrations are still heavily represented across the conference through Microsoft and its infrastructure partners:
• Microsoft Healthcare & Industry Showcase. Microsoft's own healthcare engineering and industry teams are on site inside The Hub at Moscone Center. You can talk directly with their specialists about running Epic on Azure, Epic-to-Fabric data pipelines, and integrating Nuance DAX Copilot with Epic workflows.
• Cloud & Infrastructure Partners. Major Epic hosting and managed-services partners—including AHEAD (Booth #6253R), Accenture, Kyndryl, and NetApp—have booths on the expo floor. Their healthcare architects regularly discuss Epic on Azure migrations, disaster recovery, and storage optimization.
